<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 22.73 to 5904.90, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 0.85 to 368.18, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.09.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1304 to 1057.</p>
<p>Volume was 418,735,640, compared with 388,269,020 Monday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
